          B → (f : F) → (Fin (arity f) → DisequalityDispersion.TagAlphabet S B) → DisequalityDispersion.TagAlphabet S B
@DisequalityDispersion.finite_route_eval_embed : ∀ {V F B : Type} {arity : F → ℕ}
